{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "dd9d5b1f-440f-8af9-b50d-1d0806f433d5",
  "created_at": "2026-01-27T14:18:04-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Wilson Duarte",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T14:15:44-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T14:15:48-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, um, yeah, well, I'm calling about the plowing. Or the aftermath of it, I guess. I'm calling for my mom, she lives at 171 Annandale Road, in the North End."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T14:15:59-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 171 Annandale. And what's going on there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T14:16:03-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the bus stop at the corner is totally buried. The plow came through during that snow-to-rain thing, Sunday into Monday, and just shoved a wall of it right across the stop. Now it's all heavy and wet and it's frozen up overnight. Um, you can't even get to the curb."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T14:16:21-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, yeah, that heavy stuff gets pushed up and it turns to concrete. So the bus stop itself is blocked by the plow bank. Is it right at the corner of Annandale, or is it down the road a bit?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T14:16:35-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, it's right by her house, like two doors down. People are standing out in the street to wait. Which, you know, with cars coming, it's not great."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T14:16:45-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's not good. Okay, I'm writing that down, bus stop near 171 Annandale blocked by plow bank, people waiting in the roadway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T14:16:54-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. And, um, also, it's all icy now after the rain, so can somebody bring sand? Like the whole stretch is slick, the sidewalk and the street both."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T14:17:04-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I'll put in a request for sand at that location too. I can't promise it's first on the list, crews are working through a lot of requests since the storm, but I'll get it in today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T14:17:17-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I just, well, I'd like it sooner than later. I have to be in at work, we've got an inspection happening here later this week, and I can't be late, and I'm using that bus. Or I'm trying to."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T14:17:31-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll note it's a bus stop, that moves it up a little. Do you want a call back when it's done, or just let the crew handle it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T14:17:42-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, you can call me back, I guess. It's 401-555-0187."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T14:17:46-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0187, and your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T14:17:49-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wilson. Wilson Duarte."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T14:17:51-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Wilson. Clearing at the bus stop plus sand on Annandale by 171. I'll send that over now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T14:17:58-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Thanks. Appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T14:18:00-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You bet. Take care, stay off the ice."
    }
  ],
